{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23158","headline":"送客南迁 · 白居易","name":"送客南迁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我说南中事，君应不愿听。\n曾经身困苦，不觉语叮咛。\n烧处愁云梦，波时忆洞庭。\n春畲烟勃勃，秋瘴露冥冥。\n蚊蚋经冬活，鱼龙欲雨腥。\n水虫能射影，山鬼解藏形。\n穴掉巴蛇尾，林飘鸩鸟翎。\n飓风千里黑，䕭草四时青。\n客似惊弦雁，舟如委浪萍。\n谁人劝言笑，何计慰漂零。\n慎勿琴离膝，长须酒满瓶。\n大都从此去，宜醉不宜醒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}